01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
Bullet Train is a 2022 American action comedy film directed by
David Leitch, based on the 2010 novel by Kōtarō Isaka.

12
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
Centered around a group of assassins on a Japanese high-speed train who end up in conflict with each other, the film features an ensemble cast consisting of
Brad Pitt, Joey King, Aaron Taylor-Johnson, Brian Tyree Henry, Andrew Koji, Hiroyuki Sanada, Michael Shannon, Bad Bunny, and Sandra Bullock.

13
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
Principal photography began in Los Angeles in
November 2020 and completed in March 2021.

14
01:38:00,000 --> 01:38:06,000
Bullet Train premiered in Paris on July 18, 2022, and was theatrically released
in the United States on August 5, by Sony Pictures Releasing.

15
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
The film received mixed reviews from critics, and grossed
$239 million on a production budget of $86–90M.

